### 1. Executar função OData com parâmetro
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/odataService/customFunction(name='Satya')

### execute function
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/odataService/customFunction(name='Satya')

###service document
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud

###METADATA document
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/$metadata

### read operation on technician table/entity
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician

###select only few fields from technician table/entity
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician?$select=ID,nameFirst,nameLast

###get the count of technician entries in the database
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician/$count

###fetch only first 2 entries from technician table/entity
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician?$top=2&$skip=0

###fetch only next 2 entries from technician table/entity
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician?$top=2&$skip=2

###fetch technician entry whose ID is 14774279-1f09-4567-a812-1ef983b991a6  
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician(14774279-1f09-4567-a812-1ef983b991a6)


###fetch technician entry whose ID is 14774279-1f09-4567-a812-1ef983b991a6  
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician/14774279-1f09-4567-a812-1ef983b991a6

### filter operator examples
###fetch technician entry whose gender is 'F'
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician?$filter=gender eq 'F'

###fetch first 2 female records from technician table/entity
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician?$filter=gender eq 'F'&$top=2

###fetch technician where nameFirst contains 1477433
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician?$filter=contains(nameFirst,'1477433')

###fetch technician where nameFirst starts with nameFirst
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician?$filter=startswith(nameFirst,'nameFirst')

###fetch the technicians where Salaryamount is more- descending order
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician?$orderby=Salaryamount desc

###fetch the technicians where Salaryamount is more- descending order-pagination
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician?$orderby=Salaryamount desc&$top=2

###fetch parent data
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/serviceTicket

###fetch single service ticket with id 29814354-7a6c-447b-85d6-e4dc6ea8a818
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/serviceTicket(29814354-7a6c-447b-85d6-e4dc6ea8a818)

###fetch child data of service ticket with id 29814354-7a6c-447b-85d6-e4dc6ea8a818
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/serviceTicket(29814354-7a6c-447b-85d6-e4dc6ea8a818)/Items

###fetch child data of service ticket with id 29814354-7a6c-447b-85d6-e4dc6ea8a818 and  parent data as well
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/serviceTicket(29814354-7a6c-447b-85d6-e4dc6ea8a818)?$expand=Items



###implement read on parent view spre part view
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ViewsOdata/SparePartView


###get child view data ticket item view
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ViewsOdata/TicketItemView

###fetch parent and child data for a particular parent
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ViewsOdata/SparePartView(PartNumber='part_number-15484227')?$expand=TicketItems


###get filtered child data
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ViewsOdata/SparePartView(PartNumber='part_number-14887007')?$expand=TicketItems($filter=TicketNumber eq 'ticket_number-29814345')



###create technician entry
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician
Content-Type: application/json

{     
      "nameFirst": "nameFirst-1477491",
      "nameLast": "nameLast-1477491",
      "email_adress": "email-1477491",
      "phone": "phone-1477491",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "77424",
      "country_code": "212",
      "currency_code": "629",
      "salaryAmount": 3551063061901.03,
      "accountNumber": "ntNumber-1477491",
      "bankId": "bankId-1477491",
      "bankName": "bankName-1477491"
}

###count
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician/$count

###PATCH technician 1477424e-c2b3-48c1-adcc-7de32ab6037d
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician(1477424e-c2b3-48c1-adcc-7de32ab6037d)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phone": "phone-1477489"
}

###get full name technician 1477424e-c2b3-48c1-adcc-7de32ab6037d
