{
    "newPhone": "NOVOphone-1477489"
}

###get full name technician 1477424e-c2b3-48c1-adcc-7de32ab6037d
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/Technician(31165409-1b42-48ab-afc6-8c9b5828f5ee)

###get all technician 1477424e-c2b3-48c1-adcc-7de32ab6037d
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/getFullNamesTechnicians

###get all technician 1477424e-c2b3-48c1-adcc-7de32ab6037d
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/getHighestPaidTechnician

###get all technician 1477424e-c2b3-48c1-adcc-7de32ab6037d
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crud/resetAllTechnicianPhones